# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the build reads.
# The deny patterns after it use **/ so a secret-shaped file nested inside an
# allowed directory is dropped too.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.csr
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.x509
**/sep2-certs
**/*.log
